# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Web3Forms access key (REQUIRED for the contact form)
#
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter the email address where you want
#    contact-form messages delivered (e.g. ahamedroshan426@gmail.com).
# 2. Web3Forms instantly generates an Access Key for that email.
# 3. Copy this file to `.env` and paste your key below.
# 4. Restart the dev server (yarn dev) after creating/editing .env.
#
# NOTE: Vite exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ inside the client-side
# bundle. That is expected for Web3Forms — the access key is designed for
# public frontend use. NEVER put private/server secrets in VITE_ variables.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your_web3forms_access_key_here
